OL,3,GNEWSAI turned my entire house pink `
OL,4,Anow I'm selling it
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house decorated in pink both inside
OL,7,Fand out and nicknamed "The Pink Palace"
OL,8,Fby its owner has been put up for sale.
OL,10,FThe four-to-five-bed property in
OL,11,FBrookside, Sandhurst, which was
OL,12,Foriginally built as a three-bedroom
OL,13,Fdetached bungalow, has been put on the
OL,14,Fmarket for #725,000.
OL,16,FOwner Sarah, 46, who lives with her
OL,17,Fhusband and stepson, said she had
OL,18,F"loved pink for probably as long as I
OL,19,Fcan remember" and it had "become like a
OL,20,Fpersonal brand".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
