OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event consultant has lived in the
OL,7,Fhouse for eight years and said the
OL,8,Fproperty listing - which describes the
OL,9,Fhouse as "immaculately presented
OL,10,Fthroughout" - had had 19,000 views.
